docs {
  # GET /api/pricing/ — List pricing

  Returns paginated pricing with nested relations. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:33 PricingViewSet` + `PricingSerializer` (`travels/serializers.py:34`, nested `location, vehicle, service_type`).

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing/invalid token (see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru`)

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "count": 1,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "results": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "location": { "id": 1, "name": "Alegranza" },
        "vehicle": { "id": 1, "name": "Luxury SUV", "passengers": 4 },
        "service_type": { "id": 1, "name": "One Way" },
        "price": 80.0
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Prices are numbers (float) per `Pricing.price`; example totals `80.00` One Way / `160.00` Round Trip for Lux SUV at Alegranza per current `pricing.csv`. See `get_filtered.bru` for filter params.

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
